[
{
  type: install
  message: <<INSTALL
caddy-custom includes extra modules: layer4, dynamic_dns, rate_limit,
cloudflare DNS and wstunnel.

- Edit %%ETCDIR%%/Caddyfile (created from Caddyfile.sample on first install).
- Drop-in files: %%ETCDIR%%/Caddyfile.d/*.caddyfile
- Secrets for {env.NAME} in the Caddyfile: %%ETCDIR%%/environment
  (sh syntax, mode 0600, read by the rc script; see caddy_envfile)
- Examples and the drop-in rules: %%EXAMPLESDIR%%/README
- Enable: service caddy enable; for running as www:www see
  the header of %%PREFIX%%/etc/rc.d/caddy
INSTALL
}
]
